<title>USA: TABLE-FED RESERVE BUSINESS LOANS FELL JULY 30 WK.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FED RESERVE BUSINESS LOANS FELL JULY 30 WK.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED July 23</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............819,700 down...2,200</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......718,900 down...3,500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......597,200 down...1,200</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JULY 30</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....875,839 up.....3,992</p>
<p> Financial companies.......680,397 up.....5,498</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,955 down.....557</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,676 down.....557</p>
</text>
